  <item>
    <title>E12.有执念是好事还是坏事</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6644dab1251bd96e6c96ffbe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6644dab1251bd96e6c96ffbe</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 15 May 2024 15:54:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期辩题】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期辩题:拥有执念是好事还是坏事</span></p><span></span><p><span>【一键跳转到你感兴趣的话题】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a> 即兴辩论环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 辩题开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="626">10:26</a> 你怎么什么事情都往外说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="815">13:35</a> 我一定会成为一名特别优秀的演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 讲个专场把自己讲难受了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1702">28:22</a> 为了稳定的工作放弃了上节目的机会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2301">38:21</a> 曾经是喜欢过你，但是现在我已经放下了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2851">47:31</a> 想当明星吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【主播】大脸，童童，三金，西亚</span></p><span></span><p><span>【音乐】youra-미미 (MIMI)</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果觉得还不错的话欢迎订阅喔~听友群+ VX: sdxbzhuli</span></p>]]></description>
